  "raw_html": "<button type='button' role='link' class='btn btn-link p-0 text-start' id='link_10' aria-label=\" Central Bureau of Investigation versus Baljeet Singh pdf\"  class='noToken' href='#' onclick=javascript:open_pdf('10','2026','2026_3_415_431','2026INSC221'); ><font size='4'> <strong>CENTRAL BUREAU OF INVESTIGATION<span class='fst-italic'> versus </span>BALJEET SINGH </strong>- <span class='escrText'>[2026] 3 S.C.R. 415</span><span class='ncDisplay'>2026 INSC 221</span><input type='hidden' id='cnr' value=ESCR010000832026></button></font><br><strong>Coram : SANJAY KUMAR<sup style=\"color: #268e97;font-size: 22px;top: 0;\" class=\"tooltip-sup\" data-tooltip=\"Author\">*</sup>, K. VINOD CHANDRAN</strong><br> Issue for Consideration Bereft of proof of the conspiracy theory and finding absence of the demand of bribe, the conviction of both the accused (A1 and A2) was overturned by the High Court. Headnotes&dagger; Prevention of Corruption Act, 1988 &ndash; s.7 &ndash; Penal Code, 1860 &ndash; s.120B Tax Officer-A2 made a demand of Rs.5 lakhs purportedly on behalf of appellant, Assessing Officer-A1 &ndash; PW1 approached CBI &ndash; PW1 is alleged to have informed A2 that he had in his possession only Rs.2 lakhs &ndash; Trap was laid &ndash; PW1 then went to the office room of A1, where<br><strong class='caseDetailsTD' ><span style='color:#212F3D' > Decision Date :</span><font color='green'> 10-03-2026</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Case No :</span><font color='green'> SPECIAL LEAVE PETITION (CRIMINAL) No. 12486/2025</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Disposal Nature :</span><font color='green'> Appeal(s) allowed</font>   <span style='color:#212F3D' > |  Bench :</span><font color='green'> 2 Judges</font></strong><div class='row my-1 mt-2 border bg-light'><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('10','2026','2026_3_415_431','2026INSC221','S')><i <i class='fas fa-columns me-2'></i>Split view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('10','2026','2026_3_415_431','2026INSC221','H'); ><i class='fas fa-file-alt me-2'></i>HTML view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_flip('10','2026','2026_3_415_431','2026INSC221');><i class='fas fa-book-open me-2' ></i>Flip view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_pdf('10','2026','2026_3_415_431','2026INSC221','N'); ><i class='fas fa-file-pdf me-2'></i>PDF</a></div></div>",
